  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Core.GameContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Context object containing all core game services.
Uses constructor injection to receive all dependencies.
Provides centralized access to services for game states and other systems.</p>
</div>
